{"surah":75,"ayahs":["<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>سِمُ بِيَوْمِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>مَةِ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>سِمُ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>فْسِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>لَّوَّامَةِ","أَيَحْسَبُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نُ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لَّن نَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>مَعَ عِظَامَهُۥ","بَلَىٰ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">قَٰ</span>دِرِينَ عَلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">أَن نُّ</span>سَوِّىَ بَنَانَهُۥ","بَلْ يُرِيدُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نُ لِيَفْجُرَ أَمَامَهُۥ","يَسْــَٔلُ أَيَّانَ يَوْمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>مَةِ","فَإِذَا بَرِقَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَصَرُ","وَخَسَفَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرُ","وَجُمِعَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسُ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرُ","يَقُولُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</s